-- the flux an edge carries between its vertices is never changed by the magnetic operator, and the electric
-- operator is diagonal in the labels: it is a constant of motion of Ĥ_E + Ĥ_B
loop-keeps-beyond : (s : SQ) → (x : EdgeEnd) → beyond (loop-push s x) ≡ beyond x
loop-keeps-beyond s x = λ i → beyond x
